			settingsHelps[4].textContent = this.getLangText("Baixa: Low Poly sem iluminação. Média: Greeble clássico. Alta: High Poly + SSAO. Ultra ⚡: Iluminação PBR HD, Oclusão SSAO e Path Tracing.", "Low: Low Poly without lighting. Medium: Classic Greeble. High: High Poly + SSAO. Ultra ⚡: HD PBR Lighting, SSAO & Path Tracing.", "Низкая: Low Poly без освещения. Средняя: Классический Greeble. Высокая: High Poly + SSAO. Ultra ⚡: PBR освещение, SSAO и трассировка путей.", "低画质: 无光照Low Poly。中画质: 经典Greeble。高画质: High Poly + SSAO。Ultra ⚡: HD PBR光照、SSAO与光追。");
			settingsHelps[5].textContent = this.getLangText("Escolha o idioma dos textos do jogo / Choose the game language.", "Choose the game language.", "Выберите язык интерфейса игры.", "选择游戏显示语言。");
